  "claim_boundary": "The constructive Z^6 control admits a mathematically consistent, A5-covariant homomorphism into three-dimensional icosahedral translations. On this declared adapter, the signed-step operator has the frozen FZ-11 plane-wave symbol and exact coefficient relations. Canonical A1-A3 do not select the source law, the adapter, a physical sector, or a physical readout. The modulo-three observer meaning does not factor the R3 map. The integer image is an injective, dense index-eight submodule of (a/sqrt(2+phi))*Z[phi]^3, so it is a finite-range operator on an assumed continuous field rather than a locally finite lattice or quasicrystal. No comparison is permitted and issue #662 remains unarmed.",
